| `backend/apps/subscriptions/views.py` | Payment initiation and confirmation callbacks. |
| `frontend/src/pages/app/Subscription.jsx` | Pricing and payment initiation UI. |
| `frontend/src/components/app/PromptResult.jsx` | Rendering of AI recommendation output. |
